# AZ-COM Design System v2.0.0

This rule replaces `mt-design-tokens.mdc` with a comprehensive reference derived from
the client's Design Guideline v2.0.0. Every component CSS must comply.

---

## 1. Color Tokens

All colors MUST reference CSS variables defined in `base.css`.
Hard-coding hex / rgb values in component CSS is **forbidden** (except inside SVG data URIs).

### Core Palette

| Token | Hex | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `--color-primary-dark` | `#22326e` | Header, brand headings, important navigation |
| `--color-primary` | `#1c64f2` | Links, Active state, CTA buttons |
| `--color-primary-light` | `#e8f0fe` | Backgrounds, card fill, highlight areas |
| `--color-primary-light-2` | `#b9cffb` | Borders, secondary background |
| `--color-accent` | `#df4661` | Emphasis headings, decorative accents |
| `--color-accent-dark` | `#bc2630` | Gradient endpoint, hover emphasis |
| `--color-text-primary` | `#424242` | Main body text |
| `--color-text-secondary` | `#757575` | Secondary text, dates, captions |
| `--color-white` | `#ffffff` | Backgrounds, card fill, text on dark |
| `--color-bg` | `#f5f7fa` | Page background |
| `--color-border` | `#e0e0e0` | Borders, dividers |

### Extended (component-derived)

| Token | Hex | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `--color-primary-medium` | `#1447ac` | Mega-menu title |
| `--color-primary-light-3` | `#ebf3ff` | Mobile drawer background |
| `--color-primary-light-4` | `#97b8f9` | Focus ring / CTA border |
| `--color-border-light` | `#d3d3d3` | Light separator |
| `--color-bg-alt` | `#f5f5f5` | Alternative background (footer nav) |

### Gradients

Gradients are **not** stored as `--gradient-*` custom properties in `:root`. Use:

- Utility classes **`u-gradient-primary`** / **`u-gradient-accent`** in `utility.css`, or
- `background: linear-gradient(...)` with **`var(--color-*)`** only (no hex in component rules).

| Utility / pattern | Definition | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `.u-gradient-primary` | `linear-gradient(to bottom right, var(--color-primary-dark), var(--color-primary))` | Hero, Key Visual |
| `.u-gradient-accent` | `linear-gradient(to right, var(--color-accent), var(--color-accent-dark))` | CTA emphasis (limited) |

### Usage Rules

- `Primary Dark` for brand headings and key navigation.
- `Primary Blue` for interactive elements (buttons, links).
- `Accent Red` limited to emphasis positions only.
- `Blue Gradient` for Hero / Key Visual / wide backgrounds.
- `Red Gradient` for primary CTA emphasis only.
- Default body text: `Text Primary`. Supplemental info: `Text Secondary`.

