## 2. Typography

### Font Families

| Token | Value | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `--font-main` | `"Noto Sans JP", sans-serif` | Body, Japanese text, headings |
| `--font-secondary` | `Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif` | Labels, Latin/numeric only |

### Type scale (base.css)

| Token | Size | Typical use |
|---|---|---|
| `--font-size-2xs` | `13px` | Compact UI (nav tight) |
| `--font-size-xs` | `14px` | Small text, breadcrumb |
| `--font-size-sm` | `16px` | Body |
| `--font-size-md` | `18px` | Emphasis body |
| `--font-size-lg` | `20px` | Subhead / H4-range |
| `--font-size-xl` | `24px` | H3-range |
| `--font-size-2xl` | `28px` | Section / mega titles |
| `--font-size-3xl` | `32px` | H2-range |
| `--font-size-4xl` | `40px` | H1-range |

Guideline PC/SP heading sizes (40→30, 32→26, …) are applied in **components** via responsive rules, not separate `*-pc` / `*-sp` tokens.

### Line-height Tokens

| Token | Value | Usage |
|---|---|---|
| `--line-height-body` | `1.6` | Standard body |
| `--line-height-body-relaxed` | `1.75` | Long-form text |
| `--line-height-heading` | `1.3` | Headings |
| `--line-height-nav` | `1.4` | Navigation, buttons |

### Responsive Rule

- H1: `40px -> 30px`, H2: `32px -> 26px`, H3: `24px -> 20px`, H4: `20px -> 18px`.
- Body / Small Text sizes do NOT shrink on SP.
- SP readability via spacing and width adjustments, not font-size reduction.

---

## 3. Spacing Scale

8px base system. Only approved values allowed.

| Token | Value | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `--space-xs` | `4px` | Icon-text gap, micro spacing |
| `--space-sm` | `8px` | Intra-component gaps |
| `--space-md` | `16px` | Card content, intra-section |
| `--space-lg` | `24px` | Card padding, inter-section |
| `--space-xl` | `32px` | Large section gap, card margin |
| `--space-2xl` | `40px` | Major section spacing |
| `--space-3xl` | `48px` | Card group spacing |
| `--space-4xl` | `60px` | Large section dividers |
| `--space-5xl` | `64px` | Page section spacing |
| `--space-6xl` | `80px` | Desktop page container padding |

For **10px** / **20px** (guideline SM++ / MD+), use literals or `calc(var(--space-md) + var(--space-xs))` for 20px where needed.

### SP Adjustments

- Container Padding: `80px (PC) -> 20px (SP)`.
- Section gap: `64px -> 40px`.
- Card gap: `16px -> 10px`.
- Button gap: `7-9px` depending on placement.

---

## 4. Border Radius

| Token | Value | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `--radius-sm` | `4px` | Tags, small elements |
| `--radius-md` | `8px` | Cards, standard buttons |
| `--radius-lg` | `12px` | Emphasis cards, tabs, modals |
| `--radius-pill` | `9999px` | CTA buttons (PC and SP both) |

### Rules

- Default component radius: `8px`.
- Emphasis UI: `12px`.
- Pill CTA: always `9999px`, never `32px`.
- `10px` is NOT a valid radius token.

---

## 5. Shadows

| Token | Value | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `--shadow-sm` | `0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.05)` | Light elevation (header) |
| `--shadow-md` | `0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)` | Medium elevation (mega menu) |
| `--shadow-focus-primary` | `0 0 0 3px rgba(28,100,242,0.4)` | Focus ring on primary |

Component-specific shadows may use `rgba(...)` inline but the base color must trace
back to a token color (e.g., `rgba(28, 100, 242, ...)` = `--color-primary`).

